  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\nGiven equation: 26 - 13 + 18 ÷ 54 × 24 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n1. - and ×\n\n__**26 × 13**__ + __**18 ÷ 54**__ - 24 = 31\n\n⇒ __**338**____** + 0.33**__ - 24 = 31\n\n⇒ __**338.3**____** - 24**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 314.3 ≠ 31\n\n2. × and ÷\n\n26 - 13 + 18 × __**54 ÷ 24**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 26 - 13 + __**18 **____**× 2.25**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __**26**__ - 13 __**+ 40.5**__ = 31\n\n⇒ **__30.5__**__** - 13**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 17.5 ≠ 31\n\n3. - and +\n\n26 + 13 - 18 ÷ 54 × 24 = 31\n\n⇒ 26 + 13 - __**18 ÷ 54 × 24**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __**26 +**____** 13**__ - 8 = 31\n\n⇒ __**39**____** -**____** 8**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 31 = 31\n\n4. + and ÷\n\n26 - 13 ÷ 18 + 54 × 24 = 31\n\n⇒ 26 - __**13 **____**÷**____** 18**__ + __**54 × 24**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __**26**__ - 0.72 __**+ **__**__1296__** = 31\n\n⇒ **__1322__**__** - 0.72**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 1321.28 ≠ 31\n\nHence, '**- and +**' is the correct answer.",
